0..74 Comment "// Effects as data. A program over a row of operations is a tree, the free"
75..151 Comment "// model of those operations: a result, or one operation of the row with the"
152..228 Comment "// continuation that awaits its reply. The row is a type parameter, a sum of"
229..303 Comment "// operation types, so an operation outside the row has no injection to be"
304..382 Comment "// written, and every declaration here is pure. Follows Swierstra, \"Data types"
383..462 Comment "// à la carte\" (JFP 2008), for the row as a sum of signatures, and Plotkin and"
463..540 Comment "// Pretnar, \"Handling algebraic effects\" (LMCS 2013), for a handler as a fold"
541..562 Comment "// of the free model."
